    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The Applicant is seeking anticipatory bail in connection with C.R.No. 33 of 2024 registered at Roha Police Station, Raigad, on 22/02/2024, under sections 328 of the Indian Penal Code and under Section 26(2)(i), 26(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
