        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Heard Mr. Asif Ali, learned counsel for the Applicant and Ms. Ganapathy, learned APP for the Respondent-State.\n y.s.patil   12-ABA-813-2024.odt 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1096,
      "end": 1242,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Asif Ali",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1106,
          "end": 1114
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganapathy",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1158,
          "end": 1167
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The FIR is lodged by police constable Hari Mengal.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1243,
      "end": 1293,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Hari Mengal",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1281,
          "end": 1292
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11906014382839203
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "He has stated that he is working at Roha Police Station since 2018.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1294,
      "end": 1361,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Roha Police Station",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1330,
          "end": 1349
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13332664966583252
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "On 22/02/2024, when he was present in the Police Station, the Police Officers received a secret information that a Tempo bearing No. MH-06-BJ-4504, was travelling from Nagothane towards Roha.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1362,
      "end": 1553,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "22/02/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1365,
          "end": 1375
        },
        {
          "text": "Nagothane",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1530,
          "end": 1539
        },
        {
          "text": "Roha",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1548,
          "end": 1552
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22711679339408875
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "It was carrying the prohibited food articles like tobacco and gutkha.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1554,
      "end": 1623,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24492652714252472
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The Police officers arranged to conduct a raid.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1624,
      "end": 1672,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22009852528572083
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "At about mid-night, they intercepted the said tempo and asked the driver to stop it.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1673,
      "end": 1757,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2352176308631897
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "However, it was not immediately stopped.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1758,
      "end": 1798,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2123144418001175
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "It was stopped at some distance.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1799,
      "end": 1831,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25001874566078186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The driver got down from the tempo and ran away.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1832,
      "end": 1880,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25739985704421997
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The Police Officers chased him but he was not caught.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1881,
      "end": 1934,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2561582922935486
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "It is specifically mentioned in the FIR that the first informant had recognised him and it was the present Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1935,
      "end": 2052,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1559302806854248
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "His name is mentioned in the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2053,
      "end": 2086,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18099048733711243
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "It is mentioned that the driver was Roshan Pair, resident of Virjoli.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2087,
      "end": 2156,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Roshan Pair",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2123,
          "end": 2134
        },
        {
          "text": "Virjoli",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2148,
          "end": 2155
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1573076695203781
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The tempo was searched.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2157,
      "end": 2180,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27646270394325256
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "It was found that there were 44 packets of pan masala and 44 packets of tobacco.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2181,
      "end": 2261,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2695969343185425
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "These are the banned articles under the Food Safety and Standards Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2262,
      "end": 2332,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2302,
          "end": 2331
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5012818574905396
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "Samples were drawn for analysis.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2333,
      "end": 2365,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2454218715429306
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Property was seized.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2366,
      "end": 2386,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2982100248336792
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "On this basis, the FIR is lodged.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2387,
      "end": 2420,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2699134349822998
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "y.s.patil 2 of 4  12-ABA-813-2024.odt 4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2421,
      "end": 2463,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the Applicant submitted that the prosecution case is not true.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2464,
      "end": 2546,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2558552324771881
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "The Applicant was not a well known person who could have been identified by the first informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2547,
      "end": 2643,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30273935198783875
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "There are vague allegations against the Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2644,
      "end": 2694,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23430807888507843
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "He submitted that he is falsely implicated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2695,
      "end": 2738,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2809202969074249
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "5. Learned APP submitted that the Applicant has one more case registered against him in the year 2018 of which the concerned Magistrate had taken cognizance.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2740,
      "end": 2897,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18552377820014954
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "She further submitted that since the Applicant is from the same area, the first informant was knowing him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2898,
      "end": 3004,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2062508463859558
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "That is how his name is mentioned in the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3005,
      "end": 3050,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12472425401210785
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Roshan Subhash Pair vs State Of Maharashtra on 26 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/129410039/\n2",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3051,
      "end": 3170,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Roshan Subhash Pair vs State Of Maharashtra on 26 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 3052,
          "end": 3127
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32553839683532715
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "6. I have considered these submissions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3171,
      "end": 3210,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "The FIR speaks for itself.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3211,
      "end": 3237,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23352046310901642
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "The Applicant had not co-operated with the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3238,
      "end": 3295,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30052077770233154
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "He had got down from the tempo and had ran away.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3296,
      "end": 3344,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2786039113998413
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "At this stage, there is no reason to disbelieve the first informant who has mentioned the Applicant's name and has also mentioned his village.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3345,
      "end": 3487,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2997134327888489
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "The informant was knowing the Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3488,
      "end": 3528,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "The FIR is y.s.patil 3 of 4 12-ABA-813-2024.odt lodged immediately.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3529,
      "end": 3596,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "The tempo was found containing the contraband articles.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3597,
      "end": 3652,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": "The offence is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3653,
      "end": 3677,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24342156946659088
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
      "text": "In this view of the matter, the custodial interrogation of the Applicant is necessary to find out who is the supplier and the receiver of the said property.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3678,
      "end": 3834,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3184770941734314
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 51,
      "text": "Considering these aspects, no case for grant of anticipatory bail is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3835,
      "end": 3914,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24442632496356964
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 52,
      "text": "The Application is rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
